{
  "info": {
    "name": "Sentinel AML - Demo Walkthrough",
    "description": "End-to-end walkthrough of Sentinel AML.\n\nDetection does NOT run during ingestion. sentinel-aml-service stores the transaction and returns a reference and a status. A Debezium connector reads the row off the Postgres write-ahead log, publishes it to Kafka, and sentinel-aml-engine evaluates the rule book and writes the alert. Alerts therefore appear a moment after the transaction is posted, not in its response.\n\nRun the requests in order. Steps 02 to 10 create the data, step 11 reads the alerts the engine raised, and steps 19 to 25 walk an alert through the case workflow to a SAR escalation and its audit trail.\n\nIf step 11 finds no alerts, the engine has not consumed the change events yet. Send it again. If it never finds any, check that the engine is running and that the connector at localhost:8083 reports RUNNING.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Transactions need a business timestamp, and every run needs unique references.",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('now', new Date().toISOString());",
          "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('runId')) {",
          "  pm.collectionVariables.set('runId', Date.now());",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8081"
    },
    {
      "key": "analystUser",
      "value": "analyst"
    },
    {
      "key": "analystPassword",
      "value": "analyst"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminUser",
      "value": "admin"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminPassword",
      "value": "admin"
    },
    {
      "key": "runId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "now",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "customerRef",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "accountRef",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "alertRef",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "caseRef",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "alertTries",
      "value": "0"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
